      "width": 905,
      "height": 13,
      "strokeColor": "#5a3a0a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "a replica holding live sockets but zero lag can scale to zero and drop clients — use a connection-aware trigger, graceful drain, or minReplicaCount: 1 (not implemented here).",
